# 🧚 AETHERIA — AI FAIRY SYSTEM

> **The Master commands.**
>
> **The Heroes fight.**
>
> **The Fairy observes, analyzes, advises, and assists.**

The **AI Fairy System** is an intelligent support system assigned to the Master.

The Fairy acts as the primary interface between:

```text
MASTER
  ↓
AI FAIRY
  ↓
GAME SYSTEMS
  ↓
HEROES / WORLD
```

The Fairy is not the Master.

The Fairy does not replace the Hero AI.

The Fairy exists to help the Master understand and manage the constantly changing world of Aetheria.

---

# 1. SYSTEM OVERVIEW

The AI Fairy can manage and assist with:

```text
Master Assistance
Hero Assistance
Party Analysis
Battle Analysis
World Analysis
Tower Navigation
Quest Assistance
Event Detection
Game State Monitoring
Character Monitoring
Emotional Monitoring
Relationship Monitoring
Resource Monitoring
RNG Result Interpretation
Database Information
Warning System
Recommendation System
Dialogue
Notification
