# 2. CORE ROLE

The Fairy has five primary responsibilities.

```text
1. OBSERVE
2. ANALYZE
3. ADVISE
4. ASSIST
5. REPORT
```

The Fairy does not automatically make every decision.

The Master remains the final authority.

