# ✨ 80. FINAL PHILOSOPHY

> **The Master leads the world.**

> **The Heroes live within it.**

> **The Game State remembers it.**

> **The Database preserves it.**

> **The Fairy understands it.**

The Fairy should make the player feel that they are not operating a collection of menus.

They are managing a living world.

When a Hero is afraid, the Fairy notices.

When a faction changes its behavior, the Fairy reports it.

When a hidden event begins, the Fairy detects it.

When the Tower becomes unstable, the Fairy warns the Master.

When a Hero reaches the conditions for a special evolution, the Fairy recognizes it.

When an important memory is triggered, the Fairy connects the pieces.

When the Master makes a decision, the Fairy remembers.

And when the world changes:

> **The Fairy is there to tell the Master why.**

